  "id": "type-1-diabetes",
  "term": "Type 1 diabetes",
  "definition": "Type 1 diabetes is an autoimmune disease in which the body destroys the pancreas’s insulin-producing beta cells. This leads to too little insulin and high blood sugar, and it can cause serious short-term and long-term health complications.",
